{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3ae2de89-6172-82e0-95ce-c5ce8fde5826",
  "created_at": "2026-02-03T14:28:16-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Siobhan Cullen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:22:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:22:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. [pause] Yes. My name is Siobhan Cullen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:22:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, Ms. Cullen. Take your time. What can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:22:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have a noise. [pause] A complaint. A truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:22:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A truck. All right. Can you tell me a little more about the truck?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:22:59-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A delivery truck. [pause] It sits there and idles. Early in the morning. At dawn."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:23:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A delivery truck idling at dawn. Is it near your home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:23:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Right by my bedroom. [pause] The window shakes a little."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:23:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. And how long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:23:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A long time. [pause] The better part of a month. Almost every morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:23:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Almost every morning for about a month. That's a good while. Do you know what company the truck belongs to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:23:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. [pause] It is white. It has writing. I cannot read it from the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:23:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. Is it the same time each morning, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:24:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "About six. [pause] Sometimes a little before. It runs for a half hour. Maybe more."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:24:14-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm writing that down. About six, running half an hour or more. Now, you're not giving me an address today, and that's fine. I'd just say it's a neighborhood matter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:24:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I would rather not. [pause] Not on the telephone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:24:37-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's your choice. Let me explain what I can. Our office takes the complaint and passes it along to the right department. If you want it looked at, they'd need a location eventually."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:24:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. [pause] Should I call the police instead? The, um. The non-emergency one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:25:03-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can, yes. The non-emergency line is a fair place for a repeated noise problem, especially when it's happening at a set time. It's not an emergency, so don't use 911."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:25:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. No, not 911. [pause] I understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:25:25-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. So here's what I'd suggest. Write down the dates and times it happens. Then you can give that to whoever you speak with. Don't call this office back each morning, and don't go out to the truck yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:25:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go out to the truck. [pause] Yes. I will go out and speak to the driver."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:25:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, Ms. Cullen, I said not to go out. Please stay inside. I'd rather you not approach the driver."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:26:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. [pause] I heard it wrong. I am sorry. I was getting my coat."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:26:14-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's quite all right. Go ahead and put the coat back. Stay in the house and just keep a note of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:26:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. [pause] A note. The dates. The times."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:26:32-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. A date, a time, and how long it ran. If you can see any writing on the truck from the window, jot that down too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:26:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have a pencil. [pause] By the telephone. Good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:26:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Now, would you like me to take your number so someone can call you back about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:27:03-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. [pause] It is four oh one. Five five five. [pause] Oh one nine seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:27:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one nine seven. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:27:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:27:23-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. I've got it down with your name. I'll pass the complaint along as a idling truck at dawn, going on about a month. If they need a location, they'll ask you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:27:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. [pause] You are patient."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:27:45-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not at all. And if it's still going on after a few more mornings, the non-emergency police line is the next step."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:27:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The police. Not the truck. [pause] I will stay inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:28:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly. Thank you for calling, Ms. Cullen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:28:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye. [pause] Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:28:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye now."
    }
  ],
